@startuml
title Architecture Fonctionnelle – CoreService V2

actor "Client HTTP" as Client
actor "Système de supervision" as Monitoring
actor "Pipeline CI/CD\n(GitHub Actions)" as CICD
actor "Registry GHCR" as GHCR

rectangle "CoreService API (Container Docker)" as API {

  usecase "Health Check Technique\n/actuator/health" as U1
  usecase "Health Check Applicatif\n/api/health" as U2
}

Client --> U2 : GET /api/health
Monitoring --> U1 : GET /actuator/health

CICD --> GHCR : Push image\ncoreservice:latest
GHCR --> API : Pull image\ncoreservice:latest

note right of U1
  Retourne l'état technique Spring Boot :
  - status: "UP"
  - détails internes Actuator
end note

note right of U2
  Retourne l'état applicatif :
  {
    "version": "v2",
    "status": "UP"
  }
end note

note bottom of CICD
  Le pipeline CI/CD :
  - build Maven
  - build Docker multi-stage
  - push GHCR
  - smoke test
end note

note bottom of GHCR
  Registry d'images :
  - stockage de l'image finale
  - pull par l'environnement d'exécution
end note

@enduml